1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Grinding when you brake

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
is not "almost time." It is past time.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,800
Squealing is usually the wear
indicator doing its job —

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,000
an early warning.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,800
Grinding is metal on metal.

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,000
You are cutting into
the rotor right now.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
One is a brake job.

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The other is a brake
job, plus rotors.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Send this to someone whose car
is making one of these sounds.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — link in bio.
